{"id":"n71881-1-7","stage":2,"title":"의상 · 服装","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71881-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 무슨 날이니? 정말 예쁘다.","zh":"今天是什么日子啊？真漂亮呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날이니?","meaning":"日子","explanation":"날：日子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"4","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘다.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"日子","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"以某种理由指定下来的一天。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/62906831437ddd715223.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71881-1-7-2","ko":"기분 좀 내려고 의상에 신경 좀 썼어.","zh":"为了让自己心情好一点，所以在服装上花了一些心思。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기분","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려고","meaning":"表示前句中的行动依靠自己的力量最终得以实现。","explanation":"내다：表示前句中的行动依靠自己的力量最终得以实现。；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60625","senseId":"1","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의상에","meaning":"服装，衣裳","explanation":"의상：服装，衣裳；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"의상","audio":"/audio/faa9671fe4a52a7233be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71881","senseId":"1","lemma":"의상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신경","meaning":"神经","explanation":"신경：神经","readings":[{"term":"신경","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13994","senseId":"2","lemma":"신경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"썼어.","meaning":"花，费，花费","explanation":"쓰다：花，费，花费；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"5","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"表示前句中的行动依靠自己的力量最终得以实现。","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"60625","definition":"表示前句中的行动依靠自己的力量最终得以实现。","pronunciation":["내ː다"]},{"id":"faa9671fe4a52a72","term":"의상","zh":"服装，衣裳","audio":"/audio/faa9671fe4a52a7233be.mp3","entryId":"71881","definition":"人穿的衣服。","pronunciation":["의상"]},{"id":"601d03a22ce3fa90","term":"신경","zh":"神经","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3","entryId":"13994","definition":"对某事的感觉或想法。","pronunciation":["신경"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"花，费，花费","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事用时间或钱。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8e177d5d2131513d3911.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.315,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71881","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天是什么日子啊？真漂亮呢。","为了让自己心情好一点，所以在服装上花了一些心思。","孩子，看看镜子吧。你的头发乱糟糟的哦。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天是什么日子啊？真漂亮呢。","为了让自己心情好一点，所以在服装上花了一些心思。","孩子，看看镜子吧。你的头发乱糟糟的哦。"],"answer":1}]}
